  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint : For Metallic Conductors, $R \\propto T$ ( $R$ is the resistance)\nHence conductivity decreases with increase of Temperature\nFor semi-conductors, conductivity increases with rise of temperature due increase in number of electron-hole pairs.",
